{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, there lived a witch named Morgan le Fey in a land called Avalon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morgan was curious, and brave, and blessed with the guidance of the most legendary wizard of all time, Merlin. He taught her secrets of the universe that would have driven many mad. Was she one? Perhaps...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a quest to mend the Holy Grail and bring harmony to the universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or battle your way through if war is your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stars are in our grasp...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is our time, to seize them!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597610?t=1773283263","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597610?t=1773283263","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597610/68f17a8972eb76e296bac7a136229d60513102b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773283263","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597610/68f17a8972eb76e296bac7a136229d60513102b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773283263","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3717320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, there lived a witch named Morgan le Fey in a land called Avalon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morgan was curious, and brave, and blessed with the guidance of the most legendary wizard of all time, Merlin. He taught her secrets of the universe that would have driven many mad. Was she one? Perhaps...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a quest to mend the Holy Grail and bring harmony to the univ